    "head_commit_message": "chore(ci): github-sync makes labels and milestones and migrates open questions (spec 36 step 1)\n\nci/github/sync.py plans the fixed labels (labels.py), a milestone per\nspecs/NN-*.md, a raise-when:spec-NN label per spec and a step:NN-<id>\nlabel per `### Step <id>` heading, and creates only what is missing.\nmigrate_questions.py moves OPEN_QUESTIONS.md's open entries to issues\nlabelled `question` and one raise-when label, skipping any already\nmoved, and prints the Q<n> -> #<issue> table. Both run from the\nhand-started github-sync workflow; the tests use a fake client and a\ncopy of OPEN_QUESTIONS.md from before Q30 closed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UpoKCwsdmuqwdp3dY9Jj6h",
